  "body": "**Main does not build `camcraft-app`.**\n\nThe build fails with `E0004 non-exhaustive patterns: OpParams::MultiAxisDeburr not covered` at `crates/app/src/commands/operation/recipe.rs:78`. Two PRs merged minutes apart:\n- #3283 (`a59faa5b5`) added `OpParams::MultiAxisDeburr`.\n- #3399 (`2dd93d7ad`) added the exhaustive match in `has_saved_geometry`. Its review trial-merged an older main without #3283.\n\nEach trial merge was clean on its own. The clash shows only when both are on main.\n\n**What changed:** one line. `OpParams::MultiAxisDeburr { exclude_edges, .. }` joins the `Deburr` arm. Its `exclude_edges` are source edge picks, exactly as for the 3-axis deburr, so a recipe of a multi-axis deburr with excluded edges counts as saved geometry. A recipe without excluded edges applies, the same as for Deburr.\n\n**Tested:**\n- `cargo check -p camcraft-app --all-targets` and `-p camcraft-ui --all-targets`: build again.\n- `cut_recipe`: 20 passed.\n- The compiler's exhaustiveness check is the pin for the missing arm.\n\nNot exercised: the full quick gate. Only the build and `cut_recipe` ran.\n\nChangelog: none (fixes a build break between two unreleased merges)\n\nFixes #3717\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX\n\n",
